{
  "message": "I can help with that. First, I need to verify your account. Please provide your email address. If you don’t have access to it, share your first and last name plus your ZIP code.

Also, please share the order ID. Note: we can only cancel an order if it’s still pending, and cancellations apply to the entire order (partial item cancellation isn’t supported). If you only want to keep some items, we can cancel the whole order and you can place a new one for the items you still want.

Lastly, please confirm the reason for cancellation as either “no longer needed” or “ordered by mistake.” From your message, it sounds like “no longer needed”—is that correct?"
}
